[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "みんな、なにしてるの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What is everyone doing?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、すぐ分かるよ。ヴァレリアも余ってるとこに行って",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You'll see soon enough. Find an open spot and get in there."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ではこの長兄が、認証の一番手となろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "As the eldest, I'll be the first to authenticate."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ルイネ州の機構はこの装置が破損しており、\n修復も不能で使えなかったのですが",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The mechanism in Ruine Province had a damaged device that could not be repaired and was therefore unusable."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここのは使用可能",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This one is operational."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さあ、ナナもやってごらん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Go ahead, Nana. Give it a try."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えーと……こう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um... like this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な、なにこれ……\nなんか、耳がキーンって！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wh-what is that...? My ears are ringing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっか……これは本当に門なんだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course... this really is a gate!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナちゃん、大丈夫なの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna, are you okay?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "門の向こうに、入れたはずの手が見えない……！？\nこ、これは！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My hand went through to the other side and I can't see it...! What is this?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっと、これはトラベルゲートみたいな転送装置です。\nどこか遠くの場所と繋がっています……多分",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's a transfer device, like a travel gate. Connected to somewhere far away... probably."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "多分って、なんでそんなこと知ってるの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Probably? And why do you even know that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クレオ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Creo"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "知っているというか、なんとなく分かったっていうか。\n頭の中に門の構造とかがフッと思い浮かんで……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wouldn't say I know, exactly—it just kind of came to me. The gate's structure suddenly appeared in my head..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当に大丈夫なの？\u3000……なーんて、\nいちいち聞かないよ。レスナちゃんのことだし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you sure you're alright? ...Actually, never mind. This is you we're talking about."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。行きましょう、門の先へ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's go. Through the gate."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……うんっ！\u3000では、いざゆかん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Right! Then onward!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ゆかーん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Onward!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]